            "body": "`vim.keycode('<CR>')` and `'\\r'` are the same thing, but technically `vim.keycode()` shouldn't be used with `escape_ks = true`.\r\n```suggestion\r\n  vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(type .. line .. '\\r', 'nt', true)\r\n```",
